{"id":"1094339c54947c53","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/620_概率条件逻辑.md","title":"620 概率条件逻辑","display":"620_概率条件逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}=\\{q\\in\\mathbb Q:0\\le q\\le1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}=\\{q\\in\\mathbb Q:0\\le q\\le1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{pcond}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad\\bot,\\quad\\operatorname{neg},\\quad\\operatorname{imp},\\quad\\operatorname{pcond}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcond}:\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pcond}:\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)=\\operatorname{pcond}(q,A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)=\\operatorname{pcond}(q,A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。</p>\n<p>其余构造子的完整类型为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\quad\n\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}^{2}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{620}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{620}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{620}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有公式无绑定：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{620}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{620}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{620}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{620}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-替换与结构等价\">4. 替换与结构等价</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{620}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{620}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{620}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{620}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{620}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{620}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B))=P_{\\ge q}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\mid\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B))=P_{\\ge q}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\mid\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,620}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,620}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{620}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{620}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{620}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{620}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{620}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{620}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概率阈值公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QLe}_{620}(r,q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nr,q\\in\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\\land r\\le q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QLe}_{620}(r,q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nr,q\\in\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\\land r\\le q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QOpp}_{620}(q,r)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nq,r\\in\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\\land q+r&gt;1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QOpp}_{620}(q,r)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nq,r\\in\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\\land q+r&gt;1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义正条件缩写</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_{620}(B)=\\neg P_{\\ge1}(\\bot\\mid B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pos}_{620}(B)=\\neg P_{\\ge1}(\\bot\\mid B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{620}\n=\n\\{P_{\\ge 0}(A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{620}\n=\n\\{P_{\\ge 0}(A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Unit}^{620}\n=\n\\{P_{\\ge 1}(A\\mid A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Unit}^{620}\n=\n\\{P_{\\ge 1}(A\\mid A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{MonQ}^{620}\n=\n\\{P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\to P_{\\ge r}(A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\operatorname{QLe}_{620}(r,q)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{MonQ}^{620}\n=\n\\{P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\to P_{\\ge r}(A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\operatorname{QLe}_{620}(r,q)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg}^{620}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{Pos}_{620}(B)\\to(P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\to\\neg P_{\\ge r}(\\neg A\\mid B)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\operatorname{QOpp}_{620}(q,r)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg}^{620}\n=\n\\{\\operatorname{Pos}_{620}(B)\\to(P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\to\\neg P_{\\ge r}(\\neg A\\mid B)):\nA,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\operatorname{QOpp}_{620}(q,r)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{620}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{620}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Unit}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MonQ}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg}^{620}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{620}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{620}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Zero}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Unit}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{MonQ}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg}^{620}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>分离规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{620}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{620}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>概率条件等价规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqProb}^{620}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,\\ B\\leftrightarrow D),\\ P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow P_{\\ge q}(C\\mid D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\ q\\in\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqProb}^{620}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow C,\\ B\\leftrightarrow D),\\ P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow P_{\\ge q}(C\\mid D)):A,B,C,D\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\ q\\in\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>阈值降阶规则：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{DownQ}^{620}\n=\n\\{((P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)),P_{\\ge r}(A\\mid B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\operatorname{QLe}_{620}(r,q)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{DownQ}^{620}\n=\n\\{((P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)),P_{\\ge r}(A\\mid B)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\operatorname{QLe}_{620}(r,q)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{620}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqProb}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{DownQ}^{620}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{620}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{EqProb}^{620}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{DownQ}^{620}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>。证明对象集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 由所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span> 组成，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\)</span>。每行理由为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>假设行：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>公理行：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{620}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{620}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>MP 行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>EqProb 行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C,D,q\">\\(A,B,C,D,q\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\">\\(A_k=B\\leftrightarrow D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow P_{\\ge q}(C\\mid D)\">\\(A_i=P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow P_{\\ge q}(C\\mid D)\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_k=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_k=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>DownQ 行：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,q,r\">\\(A,B,q,r\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\">\\(A_j=P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=P_{\\ge r}(A\\mid B)\">\\(A_i=P_{\\ge r}(A\\mid B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\le q\">\\(r\\le q\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{620}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{620}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，其中有证明行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Delta_i,A_i)\">\\((\\Delta_i,A_i)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{620}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{620}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{620}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{620}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 定义\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{620}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{620}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1})\\)</span>。由证明前缀闭包，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{620}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{620}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{620}A\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{620}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{620}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{620}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{620}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{620}(\\Gamma),\\ \n\\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{620}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{620}A\\leftrightarrow C\\quad\\vdash_{620}B\\leftrightarrow D}\n{\\vdash_{620}P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow P_{\\ge q}(C\\mid D)}\\;(EqProb),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\qquad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{620}A\\leftrightarrow C\\quad\\vdash_{620}B\\leftrightarrow D}\n{\\vdash_{620}P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow P_{\\ge q}(C\\mid D)}\\;(EqProb),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\quad r\\le q}{P_{\\ge r}(A\\mid B)}\\;(DownQ).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\quad r\\le q}{P_{\\ge r}(A\\mid B)}\\;(DownQ).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-概率条件语义\">9. 概率条件语义</h1>\n<p>概率条件模型为四元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,V)\\in\\mathsf{ProbMod}_{620},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,V)\\in\\mathsf{ProbMod}_{620},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span> 是事件 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\mathcal F,\\qquad X\\in\\mathcal F\\Rightarrow W\\setminus X\\in\\mathcal F,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[W\\in\\mathcal F,\\qquad X\\in\\mathcal F\\Rightarrow W\\setminus X\\in\\mathcal F,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal F^{\\mathbb N}\\Rightarrow\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n\\in\\mathcal F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(X_n)_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal F^{\\mathbb N}\\Rightarrow\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n\\in\\mathcal F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal F\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[0,1]\">\\(\\mu:\\mathcal F\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 是概率测度：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mu(W)=1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mu(W)=1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\forall i\\ne j\\ X_i\\cap X_j=\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n\\right)=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mu(X_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\forall i\\ne j\\ X_i\\cap X_j=\\varnothing\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\mu\\!\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n\\right)=\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mu(X_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span> 定义带零分母约定的条件概率</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CP}_{\\mu}(X\\mid Y)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{\\mu(X\\cap Y)}{\\mu(Y)},&amp;\\mu(Y)&gt;0,\\\\\n1,&amp;\\mu(Y)=0.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CP}_{\\mu}(X\\mid Y)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\dfrac{\\mu(X\\cap Y)}{\\mu(Y)},&amp;\\mu(Y)&gt;0,\\\\\n1,&amp;\\mu(Y)=0.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>零分母取值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\ge1}(A\\mid A)\">\\(P_{\\ge1}(A\\mid A)\\)</span> 保持有效；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg}^{620}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{Neg}^{620}\\)</span> 中的\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}_{620}(B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pos}_{620}(B)\\)</span> 则精确排除这一退化情形。</p>\n<p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{ProbMod}_{620}\">\\(\\mathcal M\\in\\mathsf{ProbMod}_{620}\\)</span>，解释函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{620}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\\quad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M},\\quad\n⟦ A\\to B⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;\\operatorname{CP}_{\\mu}(⟦ A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}\\mid\n⟦ B⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M})\\ge q,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{否则}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;\\operatorname{CP}_{\\mu}(⟦ A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}\\mid\n⟦ B⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M})\\ge q,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{否则}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{620}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in⟦ A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{620}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nw\\in⟦ A⟧_{620}^{\\mathcal M}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{620}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,V)\\in\\mathsf{ProbMod}_{620}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{620}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{620}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{620}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,\\mathcal F,\\mu,V)\\in\\mathsf{ProbMod}_{620}\\ \\forall w\\in W\\\n((\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{620}B)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{620}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本系统的目标构造子是带有有理阈值的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\">\\(P_{\\ge q}(A\\mid B)\\)</span>。阈值集合、单调公理、带正条件守卫的互补不相容公理与等价替换规则均在本文件内定义；第 9 节用概率空间和显式零分母约定给出数值语义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PCond}_{620}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]},\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\operatorname{FV}_{620},\\operatorname{BV}_{620},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{620},\\operatorname{Sub}_{620},\\equiv_{\\alpha,620},\\operatorname{QLe}_{620},\n\\operatorname{QOpp}_{620},\\operatorname{Pos}_{620},\\mathsf{Ax}_{620},\\mathsf{Rule}_{620},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{620},\\operatorname{last}_{620},\\vdash_{620},\\mathsf{Thm}_{620},\\mathsf{Cert}_{620},\n\\mathsf{ProbMod}_{620},\\operatorname{CP}_{\\mu},⟦-⟧_{620},\\Vdash_{620},\\models_{620}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{PCond}_{620}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathbb Q_{[0,1]},\\mathsf{Frm}_{620},\\operatorname{FV}_{620},\\operatorname{BV}_{620},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{620},\\operatorname{Sub}_{620},\\equiv_{\\alpha,620},\\operatorname{QLe}_{620},\n\\operatorname{QOpp}_{620},\\operatorname{Pos}_{620},\\mathsf{Ax}_{620},\\mathsf{Rule}_{620},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{620},\\operatorname{last}_{620},\\vdash_{620},\\mathsf{Thm}_{620},\\mathsf{Cert}_{620},\n\\mathsf{ProbMod}_{620},\\operatorname{CP}_{\\mu},⟦-⟧_{620},\\Vdash_{620},\\models_{620}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统由概率条件句法、公理、规则、证明关系以及条件概率核语义共同组成。</p>\n<p>本条目不在此处断言概率完备性、可判定性、测度存在唯一性或算法实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-替换与结构等价","text":"4. 替换与结构等价","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-概率条件语义","text":"9. 概率条件语义","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","